<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F21.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 21</span>: </span><span id="S5.F21.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Example failure cases. Each pair of images shows input on the left and output on the right. These examples are selected as some of the worst results on our tasks. Common failures include artifacts in regions where the input image is sparse, and difficulty in handling unusual inputs. Please see <span id="S5.F21.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">https://phillipi.github.io/pix2pix/</span> for more comprehensive results.</span></figcaption>
